      "title": "Define a closed mutation-kind catalogue for create, append, add-edge, remove-edge, set, clear, transition, and compensate, with each kind carrying an explicit payload shape and target subject. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "text": "Define a closed mutation-kind catalogue for create, append, add-edge, remove-edge, set, clear, transition, and compensate, with each kind carrying an explicit payload shape and target subject. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
