      "id": "FR-002",
      "title": "Bind every mutation intent to a stable operation identity, subject, expected revision, idempotency key, and canonical intent digest. Exact replay of one key and intent is a no-op result; key reuse across a different kind, subject, revision, or payload is rejected. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "text": "Bind every mutation intent to a stable operation identity, subject, expected revision, idempotency key, and canonical intent digest. Exact replay of one key and intent is a no-op result; key reuse across a different kind, subject, revision, or payload is rejected. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
